{
    "_comment":  [
                     "Which side owns a file both this product and the upstream base changed.",
                     "`ours` are directory prefixes (trailing / means the whole subtree) or exact files; everything",
                     "else keeps the vendor\u0027s bytes, because an unlisted difference is far more likely to be vendor",
                     "code this product once reformatted than a feature it must not lose.",
                     "`files` overrides the list for one path: that is where a contested file belongs once it has been",
                     "read and argued about, and `base` is the same override in the other direction.",
                     "overlay/replay.mjs --resolve writes the answer into manifest.json, so the next rebase replays it."
                 ],
